#: app/templates/product_information.html:115
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Supported subset: Digital Links with /01/{GTIN}, optional /10/{lot} then /21/{serial}, optional "
"query attribute 17 for expiry, and one optional d or digest parameter. Also supported: validated "
"GTIN/EAN/UPC and explicitly identified GS1 element strings with AIs 01, 10, 17 and 21. This is "
"not a full GS1 resolver. URLs in scanned codes and storage hints in events do not select "
"retrieval destinations."
msgstr ""
"Sous-ensemble pris en charge : Digital Links avec /01/{GTIN}, /10/{lot} puis /21/{serial} "
"facultatifs, attribut de requête 17 facultatif pour l’expiration, et un paramètre d ou digest "
"facultatif. Sont également pris en charge les GTIN/EAN/UPC validés et les chaînes d’éléments GS1 "
