"You can change this suggested label. Choose a new label to keep an existing record with the same "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez modifier ce libellé suggéré. Choisissez un nouveau libellé pour conserver un document"
" existant du même nom."

#: app/templates/scan_result.html:19
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Accepter"

#: app/templates/scan_review.html:4
